<title>USA: Pa. Hospital joins University of Pa. System - paper.</title>
<headline>Pa. Hospital joins University of Pa. System - paper.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pennsylvania Hospital voted to become part of the University of Pennsylvania Health System, rejecting a rival offer from Jefferson Health System, Philadelphia Inquirer reported Wednesday.</p>
<p>About 270 Pennsylvania Hospital physicians with faculty appointments at Jefferson will have to make a decision about their future affiliations, Jefferson said.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, Pennsylvania Hospital will keep its own identity, name and governing board. Officials did not say whether any money changed hands as part of the agreement.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
